        {
            "id": "6d6630d3-46f9-40f0-8888-716a5d1d855d",
            "build_id": "83b73a8b-9cf6-4600-9bba-122879a4715e",
            "round_number": 2,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:15:14.291015+00:00",
            "notes": "Sell [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) and [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) to allow us to upgrade to [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) while also adding [Booming Voice](item_d751b552-4c3f-49d6-966b-611096fd2259). \n\nOur [Commanding Shout] resets will now reach more of our allies and more enemies. This will allow us to obtain more Eliminations by combining with our [Reckoner\u2019s Roar](item_efe615c6-8b32-4847-9d8f-4f55adaeba52) Power, but also provide more assists on enemies who weren't tagged by it too.\n\n**Remember that [Commanding Shout] will not apply the [Wounds] from *Reckoner's Shout* on enemies behind barriers (Reinhardt Shield) or out of line of sight (LoS). Prioritise to position yourself to get in LoS of as many enemies as possible when you use [Commanding Shout] as allies are affected through walls regardless.**\n\nIt is important to try and stay alive so you can keep collecting Kill Participation.",
