            "notes": "We go for [Chop Chop](item_6f404c88-210f-473d-a7e6-e03547a074b8) because [Thrill of Battle](item_80ed7f65-e015-4dbb-ada0-fb8fa9b9b086) only has a short range, so unless you have a very brawl-y team (Reaper/Mei), [Chop Chop](item_6f404c88-210f-473d-a7e6-e03547a074b8) would be the more safer option to recommend.\n\nSell back [Bigger Magnet](item_c0acbb75-6f00-4736-9bb9-c144e168f511) to purchase [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) for a big AP power spike. You may need to sell [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) to afford this.",
