            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:15:14.291015+00:00",
            "notes": "We end with [Bow Down](item_0673e9ed-37dd-4e58-acef-77e0fbe613fb) as our final power because everyone is at their strongest now, so the knock down gives better opportunity to capitalise on [Rampage] and decrease the chance of enemies doing anything about it.\n\nIdeally, we can also purchase [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) too. I would even suggest selling [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) if you need to for it. Combined with Rampage, [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) will apply the slow effect for the entire duration and then add 3 seconds, make it a 20% slow for 7.5 seconds!\n\nIf you can afford it, you should purchase [Undying Loyalty](item_d0278c35-8006-4c8d-8f02-4fd0217fd3e2) to help your team stay alive. Note that despite this item now adding healing to [Commanding Shout], it does **not** make the ability work with Ability items that require Ability healing to provide an effect.",
